SUMMARY:Flower Pressing Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join us in person to learn how to press flowers and create beautiful keepsakes at our Flower Pressing Workshop. Join us for a super fun DIY Flower Press Workshop where you’ll get hands-on experience pressing your favorite blooms! This in-person event is perfect if you love getting creative and want to make cool keepsakes from flowers. We’ll show you all the tricks to preserve petals and leaves just right. Bring your enthusiasm and leave with your very own flower press and pressed flower art. Can’t wait to see you there and get crafty together! \nCOST: $45 Members\, $50 Non-members \nCANCELLATION: NJ Audubon’s programs require a minimum number of registrants to run. If we cancel\, due to lack of participation\, severe weather\, or unforeseen circumstances\, all participants will be notified as soon as possible and are eligible for a full refund. Participants may cancel without penalty if greater than 48 hours in advance. Sorry\, no refund for cancellations less than 48 hours in advance unless due to health emergencies; however\, registrations can be transferred to another program in the future. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/flower-pressing-workshop/
LOCATION:Lorrimer Sanctuary\, 790 Ewing Avenue\, Franklin Lakes\, NJ\, 07417\, United States
CATEGORIES:Lorrimer Sanctuary,Workshop
